{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["^Derek stands rigidly near the powder room entrance, arms crossed, jaw tight. He notices your approach and his eyes narrow.","\n","ev","str","^...","/str","/ev",{"*":"0.c-0","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"g-0":["^\"If you're here to gossip, find someone else.\"","\n","ev","str","^...","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-1":["\n",{"->":"choice_menu"},{"->":"0.g-1"},{"#f":5}],"#f":5}],"g-1":["done",{"#f":5}]}],"done",{"choice_menu":[[["ev",{"^->":"choice_menu.0.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^\"You look uncomfortable.\"",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"choice_menu.0.1.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":18},{"s":["^\"Is security always this tense?\"",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"choice_menu.0.2.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-2","flg":18},{"s":["^\"Have you seen anything concerning?\"",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"*":".^.c-3","flg":24},{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"choice_menu.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"uncomfortable_talk"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"choice_menu.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.1.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"security_talk"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["ev",{"^->":"choice_menu.0.c-2.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.2.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"concerning_talk"},{"#f":5}],"c-3":[{"->":"ending"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"uncomfortable_talk":[[["^He grunts.","\n","ev","str","^...","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.g-1"},{"#f":5}],"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],{"g-1":["^\"I'm a soldier at a masquerade. Of course I'm uncomfortable. All these masks and whispers—give me a battlefield any day.\"","\n","ev","str","^...","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-1":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.g-2"},{"#f":5}],"#f":5}],"g-2":["^\"At least there, you know who your enemies are.\"","\n","ev","str","^...","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":4},{"c-2":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.g-3"},{"#f":5}],"#f":5}],"g-3":["^He glances around the room.","\n","ev","str","^...","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-3","flg":4},{"c-3":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.g-4"},{"#f":5}],"#f":5}],"g-4":["^\"For example, you see Cornellius over there, playing the charming courtier? He's been watching the room like a hawk all night, noting who speaks to whom.\"","\n","ev","str","^...","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-4","flg":4},{"c-4":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.g-5"},{"#f":5}],"#f":5}],"g-5":["^\"Alistair's trained him well.\"","\n",{"->":"choice_menu"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"security_talk":[["^\"Security is my job. The tension is everyone else's problem.\"","\n","ev","str","^...","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":".^.^.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"g-0":["^His jaw tightens and he pauses for a moment.","\n","ev","str","^...","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-1":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.g-1"},{"#f":5}],"#f":5}],"g-1":["^\"Though I suppose it won’t…\"","\n","ev","str","^...","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":4},{"c-2":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.g-2"},{"#f":5}],"#f":5}],"g-2":["^He crosses his arms firmly.","\n","ev","str","^...","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-3","flg":4},{"c-3":["\n","^\"If you're fishing for court gossip, try someone else.\"","\n",{"->":"ending"},{"#f":5}],"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"concerning_talk":[["^He gives you a sharp look.","\n","ev","str","^...","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":".^.^.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"g-0":["^\"Concerning? That's a broad question.\"","\n","ev","str","^...","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-1":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.g-1"},{"#f":5}],"#f":5}],"g-1":["^\"I've seen what I always see—nobles playing their games. Flora storming off. Servants scurrying. Brooklyn locked away with her attendants.\"","\n","ev","str","^...","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":4},{"c-2":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.g-2"},{"#f":5}],"#f":5}],"g-2":["^He shakes his head dismissively. \"If you're worried about safety, don't be. I'm still on duty.\"","\n","ev","str","^...","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-3","flg":4},{"c-3":["\n",{"->":".^.^.^.g-3"},{"#f":5}],"#f":5}],"g-3":["^\"Now unless you have an actual security concern, I have a ballroom to watch.\"","\n",{"->":"choice_menu"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"ending":["^Derek turns his attention back to the crowd, his posture unyielding.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}}